{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.809999465942383,"text":"A man carries a calf on his shoulders, holding its four legs crossed in front of his chest. He was carved around 570 BC and was climbing the rock to offer the animal to the goddess. The best part is the calf's legs and the man's arms. Together they make a cross, the only pattern in the whole statue. His eyes were once made of a different colored material, set into the sockets. They are missing now.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.699999988079071},{"word":"man","start":0.699999988079071,"end":0.9599999785423279},{"word":"carries","start":0.9599999785423279,"end":1.3200000524520874},{"word":"a","start":1.3200000524520874,"end":1.7599999904632568},{"word":"calf","start":1.7599999904632568,"end":1.7599999904632568},{"word":"on","start":1.7599999904632568,"end":1.9199999570846558},{"word":"his","start":1.9199999570846558,"end":2.180000066757202},{"word":"shoulders","start":2.180000066757202,"end":2.559999942779541},{"word":"holding","start":3.0799999237060547,"end":3.0799999237060547},{"word":"its","start":3.0799999237060547,"end":3.319999933242798},{"word":"four","start":3.319999933242798,"end":3.680000066757202},{"word":"legs","start":3.680000066757202,"end":3.9600000381469727},{"word":"crossed","start":3.9600000381469727,"end":4.320000171661377},{"word":"in","start":4.320000171661377,"end":4.599999904632568},{"word":"front","start":4.599999904632568,"end":4.659999847412109},{"word":"of","start":4.659999847412109,"end":4.800000190734863},{"word":"his","start":4.800000190734863,"end":5.239999771118164},{"word":"chest","start":5.239999771118164,"end":5.28000020980835},{"word":"He","start":5.900000095367432,"end":6},{"word":"was","start":6,"end":6.5},{"word":"carved","start":6.5,"end":6.5},{"word":"around","start":6.5,"end":6.940000057220459},{"word":"570","start":6.940000057220459,"end":8.020000457763672},{"word":"BC","start":8.020000457763672,"end":8.399999618530273},{"word":"and","s